        "id": 1039103
      },
      "writtenOn": "2016-10-12T00:03:57Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "But what about success? If you reconfigure to a mode in which some of the interfaces could be valid ... are all interfaces torn down or a subset or what?\n\nIn any case, paragraph structure makes it appear that second sentence applies in the same condition as the first - only for failure. Please clarify or reorder (second sentence first).",
      "parentUuid": "9f7dbc55_ee5764fb",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 172,
        "startChar": 28,
        "endLine": 172,
        "endChar": 43
      },
      "revId": "0929b268a331c3a312d76f70a42c092028406427",
