        "patchSetId": 10
      },
      "lineNbr": 172,
      "author": {
        "id": 1074459
      },
      "writtenOn": "2016-10-12T00:28:46Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "All of the existing ifaces are intended to be torn down once the chip is reconfigured. Reconfiguration would most likely result in a firmware reload under the hood. So, any existing iface objects will be invalid and starts with a clean slate.\n\nReordered the comments. Since this is most likely a fatal failure, we may even want to recommend restarting the HAL after a few retries?",
      "parentUuid": "9f7dbc55_10fca6cc",
